or what I am working on. My partner will be thrilled with these, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11102-necrophear","name":"Necrophear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-08T17:51:33-08:00","id":1046087,"title":"","content":"Here's an example of the <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0xfwZaWQoGcbThnZVJnaTRmenc/view\" target=\"_blank\">Geist sheet</a>. It's not perfect, but at least it fulfills a part of the gap, especially where a higher rank geister may run into problems.<br /> <br /> Just noticed that I forgot to add a place for Vice and Virtue, present in all printed geists I've seen. Curses, update soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11102-necrophear","name":"Necrophear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}